    "faq": {
      "type": "faq-section",
      "blocks": {
        "faq_1": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "1. How do I order custom DTF transfers?",
            "answer": "Ordering your custom DTF transfers is simple.\n\nChoose your preferred transfer size, upload your artwork, select the quantity, and complete your order details. Our production team will review your file to ensure the best print quality before production begins.\n\nOrder Process:\n\n1.Upload your design file\n2.Select transfer size and quantity\n3.Confirm your order details\n4.We print, quality check, and ship your transfers\n\nWhether you need one custom transfer or thousands for your business, DESCECI makes the process fast and easy."
          }
        },
        "faq_2": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "2. How durable are DTF transfers? Will they last after washing?",
            "answer": "DESCECI DTF transfers are designed for long-lasting performance.\n\nWhen applied correctly and cared for properly, our transfers can withstand 50+ wash cycles while maintaining vibrant colors, strong adhesion, and excellent detail.\n\nFor the best results:\n\nWash garments inside out\nUse cold or warm water\nAvoid harsh bleach\nTumble dry on low heat\n\nOur premium adhesive powder and high-quality inks help create a flexible print that won't easily crack, peel, or fade."
          }
        },
        "faq_3": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "3. Can I order just one custom transfer?",
            "answer": "Yes! There is no minimum order requirement.\n\nDESCECI supports everyone from individual creators making a single custom shirt to businesses producing large-volume apparel orders.\n\nPerfect for:\n\nPersonal projects\nSmall clothing brands\nEtsy sellers\nPrint shops\nEvents & teams\nCorporate apparel\n\nOrder exactly what you need — whether it's one piece or thousands."
          }
        },
        "faq_4": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "4. What fabrics are compatible with DTF transfers?",
            "answer": "DTF transfers are one of the most versatile printing solutions available.\n\nOur transfers work great on a wide range of fabrics, including:\n\n✓ Cotton\n✓ Polyester\n✓ Cotton blends\n✓ Canvas\n✓ Fleece\n✓ Hoodies\n✓ T-shirts\n✓ Tote bags\n✓ Hats and accessories\n\nUnlike traditional printing methods, DTF technology allows you to create high-quality designs on both light and dark fabrics."
          }
        },
        "faq_5": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "5. How long does production and shipping take?",
            "answer": "Production time depends on your order quantity, artwork requirements, and current order volume.\n\nAfter your order is confirmed, our team will process your files, complete production, perform quality inspection, and prepare your shipment as quickly as possible.\n\nTypical timeline:\n\nProduction: 1–3 business days\nShipping: Depends on destination and shipping method selected\n\nWe focus on reliable quality and fast turnaround to help your business keep moving."
          }
        },
        "faq_item_3BYacL": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "6. What file formats do you accept for artwork?",
            "answer": "For the best printing results, we recommend high-resolution artwork files.\n\nSupported formats include:\n\n✓ PNG (transparent background recommended)\n✓ PDF\n✓ PSD\n✓ TIFF\n\nFor optimal results:\n\nUse 300 DPI artwork\nKeep important details clear\nUse transparent backgrounds when possible\n\nIf you are unsure about your file, our team can help review it before production."
          }
        },
        "faq_item_hVN7BY": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "7. Do you offer artwork support or design assistance?",
            "answer": "Yes.\n\nOur team can help optimize your artwork to ensure the best possible printing results.\n\nWe can assist with:\n\nFile checking\nBackground removal\nResolution improvement\nPrint preparation guidance\n\nOur goal is to make sure your designs look professional before they reach production."
          }
        },
        "faq_item_PFdYPQ": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "8. Can I use DTF transfers for business or bulk orders?",
            "answer": "Absolutely.\n\nDESCECI provides scalable solutions for businesses of all sizes.\n\nWhether you are:\n\nLaunching a clothing brand\nRunning a print shop\nCreating merchandise\nManaging team uniforms\nSelling custom apparel\n\nWe offer competitive bulk pricing and reliable production support to help your business grow."
          }
        },
        "faq_item_wieXxD": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "9. What makes DESCECI DTF transfers different?",
            "answer": "DESCECI combines premium materials, advanced printing technology, and reliable customer support to deliver professional-quality transfers.\n\nOur advantages:\n\n✓ Vibrant, detailed prints\n✓ Strong wash durability\n✓ Wide fabric compatibility\n✓ No minimum order requirements\n✓ Fast production times\n✓ Professional customer support\n\nWe help creators and businesses turn ideas into high-quality custom apparel."
          }
        },
        "faq_item_3e7R8m": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "10. Do you offer refunds or replacements?",
            "answer": "We stand behind the quality of our products.\n\nIf your order arrives damaged, defective, or has a production issue, please contact our support team with your order details and photos. We will review the issue and provide a solution as quickly as possible.\n\nFor the best customer experience, we recommend checking your artwork details carefully before placing custom orders."
          }
        }
      },
